<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA DISCOUNT RATE STEADY AT 21 PCT.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA DISCOUNT RATE STEADY AT 21 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank left its official discount rate steady on Monday at the 21 percent annual which has been in force since April 7, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The rate was set at a credit funds auction on Monday, when nine banks acquired a total of 23.72 million lei ($5.16 million) of National Bank reserves.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
